(
    title: "Crackpots",
    developer: Some("Dan Kitchen"),
    description: Some("As Potsy the gardener you patrol a Brooklyn rooftop, dropping flower pots on the bugs scaling the wall before they slip inside the windows — four species climb four different ways, from straight ascents to zig-zags between sills. Dan Kitchen\'s idea came from watching objects fall at a construction site over lunch; it began life as a prototype called Flower Power."),
